abstract: >-
  A reproducible, statistics-first framework for stock trend analysis
  and strategy evaluation: multi-source data ingestion, vectorized
  technical indicators, rule-based / momentum / gradient-boosting
  strategies, a look-ahead-bias-free backtest engine, and built-in
  statistical hypothesis testing with automated Markdown reports.
